Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that girl who disappeared and they think was murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about her on TV yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They said she'd been in some porn film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And then they showed a picture of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was almost like seeing my sister as she once looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The eyes most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they find her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of all, I hope they catch that psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise you'll be careful when you go.
